5,0,1,talk,Rin,,"I'm so excited to play! Since it's the first day, does anyone have any ideas on how we should find the werewolf?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Toshio,,We should start by observing everyone's speech patterns and how they react to each other. Let's keep the conversation open for now.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree with Toshio. Since we have no information yet, we should focus on identifying any inconsistencies in how people present themselves.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Asuka,,"Logic is key. We should be wary of anyone who tries to lead the conversation too aggressively or, conversely, anyone who stays too silent to avoid suspicion.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,I'll be watching. It's interesting that you're all so eager to establish a strategy already. Let's see who actually follows through with that logic.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shion, that sounds a bit scary! But I'll be watching too! Does anyone think they might be the Seer? Maybe they can tell us something?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Toshio,,It's too early for the Seer to reveal themselves. Doing so would make them an immediate target for the werewolf tonight. We should wait.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Toshio is right. The Seer's safety is our priority for now. If the Seer is killed on the first night, we lose our most valuable source of information.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"Exactly. The Seer should remain hidden until they have a confirmed result that can actually shift the tide of the game. For now, we just listen.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,"You're all very cautious. It's almost too predictable. I wonder if the werewolf is hiding behind that same ""logical"" mask to blend in with the crowd.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Rin,,"Hmm, Shion is making everyone sound suspicious! But maybe that's just how he talks? I'll try to look for clues in what everyone says!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Toshio,,Let's not get distracted by Shion's provocations. We should focus on the fact that we have no concrete data yet. Let's continue to observe.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree. While Shion's approach is provocative, it doesn't give us any real evidence. Let's see if anyone's behavior changes as we move toward the first vote.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Asuka,,We should also consider that the Possessed will likely try to mirror the behavior of the most trusted person in the room to avoid detection. Keep that in mind.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,"Mirroring, is it? That's a very specific observation, Asuka. It almost sounds like you're describing a manual on how to play the role. I'm curious to see who you're actually trying to protect.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Rin,,"Everyone is getting so serious! I'll just keep being me and hope we can find the bad guy together tomorrow! Good luck tonight, everyone!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Toshio,,I'll be keeping a close eye on the dynamics we've established today. Let's hope the Seer survives the night to give us a lead.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
22,0,4,pass,Toshio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
23,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,I'll be analyzing the interactions from today to see if any patterns emerge. Let's hope for a productive day tomorrow.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
24,0,4,pass,Mizuki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
25,0,4,talk,Asuka,,I'll be focusing on the contradictions in Shion's logic. Let's see if his confidence holds up when we have actual results.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
26,0,4,pass,Asuka,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
27,0,4,talk,Shion,,I'll be waiting to see who the first victim is. That usually tells us more than any of these polite conversations ever could.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
