35,1,1,talk,Rin,,"Good morning everyone! I have some really important news from last night... I'm the Seer, and I found the werewolf! It's Asuka!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"That was fast. Rin, are you sure you want to reveal yourself so early? If you're telling the truth, we have our target, but if you're lying, this is a very bold move.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Wait, Rin, are you absolutely certain? Revealing yourself this early is a huge risk. If you're the werewolf trying to frame Asuka, this is a very aggressive play.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"This is absurd. I am a villager. Rin is clearly lying to frame me, likely because she is the werewolf or the Possessed trying to eliminate a logical threat early on.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Shion,,"This is quite the development. Rin, you've certainly captured everyone's attention. Asuka, your denial is expected, but the timing of this revelation is almost too convenient. I'm curious to see who believes whom.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Rin,,"I'm not lying! I really saw it! Asuka is the werewolf, and I want to help everyone win, so I had to tell you right away!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"If Rin is the Seer, we should execute Asuka now. However, if Rin is the werewolf, she's just trying to get us to kill a villager. Mizuki, what do you think about this?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Asuka"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"It's a difficult situation. Rin's energy is consistent, but Asuka's logic is also sound. However, if Rin is the Seer, we can't afford to ignore this lead. I'm leaning toward believing Rin, but I'm still cautious.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Mizuki, don't let Rin's childish enthusiasm cloud your judgment. A real Seer would be more cautious. This is a classic deception tactic to force a quick vote before we can analyze the situation.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Shion,,"It's fascinating to watch you two clash. Asuka, you're leaning heavily on the ""logical"" argument again, but Rin's boldness is actually quite refreshing. If she's lying, she's playing a very dangerous game.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Rin,,"I'm not playing a game! I'm telling the truth! Please, everyone, believe me! If we don't vote for Asuka now, she'll just kill more of us tonight!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"If we execute Asuka and she's a villager, we've lost a valuable member and the werewolf is still among us. But if we let her live and Rin is the Seer, we're just giving the werewolf another night to kill.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Toshio, the risk of losing the Seer is higher than the risk of losing one villager. If Rin is telling the truth, we have a guaranteed win right now. I think we should trust her.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Mizuki, that is a dangerous assumption. If Rin is the werewolf, she has just successfully manipulated you into executing an innocent villager. Think logically: why would a real Seer risk everything on day one?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Shion,,"Because she's a child, Asuka. Or perhaps she's just more confident than you are. Your insistence on ""logic"" is starting to feel like a shield for someone who's been caught. I'm inclined to trust the Seer.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Rin,,"Thank you, Shion! See, I told you I'm not lying! Please, everyone, let's just vote for Asuka so we can all be safe!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"I've listened to everyone. While the risk is there, the potential reward of ending the game now is too high to ignore. I will vote for Asuka.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree with Toshio. The possibility that Rin is the Seer is too significant to overlook, and Asuka's defense is becoming repetitive. I'll vote for Asuka.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Rin"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"This is a disaster. You are all throwing away the game based on the word of a child. I am a villager, and you are making a grave mistake that the werewolf will certainly appreciate.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Shion,,"Your desperation is the most telling piece of evidence here, Asuka. I'll join the majority and vote for you. Let's see if your ""logic"" can save you from the gallows.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
